### `Invite host dies when leaving that tab`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Accept UI only works while that tab is visible; other tabs never show it | The shell built only the selected page, so the invite host was disposed | Keep tab bodies mounted (indexed stack). Offstage children still tick — widget tests that pump the shell must replace it with an empty box or pump past timers before the next case |

