### `Background BLE dies without connectedDevice`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Nearby scan/advert or GATT stops as soon as the activity is not in the foreground, even with a sharing service | The foreground service type was only `dataSync` | Add `connectedDevice` (with `dataSync`) on the sharing service and in the manifest |

