### `Apk compiles, old devices crash at runtime`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `NoSuchMethodError` on a handset below a certain API level, build and analyze green | Kotlin compiles against compileSdk: `flutter analyze` runs no Android Lint, so post-minSdk calls are invisible to the gates | Guard every method newer than minSdk with `Build.VERSION.SDK_INT` — known traps: GATT/hotspot-era Wi-Fi APIs (`WifiNetworkSpecifier` 29+, 3-arg `requestNetwork` 28+), `WifiP2pManager.Channel.close()` 27+, `canUseFullScreenIntent` 29+, FSI settings intent 34+. Below the guard, reply the channel error code instead |

