| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| No member for a name that the header lists, or a class method "has been renamed" | An Objective-C method imports as a Swift call with parentheses. A Swift 3 rename in the SDK is the name that compiles | Read the SDK header, then typecheck the call. Use the rename the compiler prints |

