### `One-platform create drops the others`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Adding a runner rewrites the project stamp and the lockfile, and the other platforms disappear from metadata | Creating a single platform replaces the platform list and runs pub get | Pass only the new platform. Restore the previous metadata entries and the lockfile. Record which SDK generated the new runner |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `Simulator build says the OS is not installed`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| A simulator build fails with the OS version not installed, while the SDK list includes that version | The SDK is present and the matching simulator runtime is not. An older runtime is not a destination for the newer SDK | Check installed runtimes, then download that platform. Create a simulator on the new runtime before launching |

