### `Plugin register runs before the engine exists`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Channel methods are missing after launch, or launch has no view controller to register against | The iOS template creates the engine later, on the implicit-engine callback | Register there. The messenger is on the application registrar, not a window controller |

